WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
I'll tell you if there's anything inappropriate

2
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:02,800
in my experience

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,760
At this time, there are the most good products on the isolated island.

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,920
On the beach and on the rocks

5
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,680
It’s all leftovers and no one has snatched them away

6
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:08,960
I'll be there alone then

7
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:09,960
Pick up whatever you want

8
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,800
You can pick up whatever you want, of course

9
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,920
Not every isolated island has experts.

10
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,600
Sometimes it takes a lot of effort to pull it up, right?

11
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:18,080
But there are only the cheapest sea red and egg vegetables on it.

12
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,880
I want to know if there are any tricks on the isolated island

13
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:23,280
You still have to judge based on your vision and experience in your previous life, but

14
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:24,320
That's it

15
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:25,240
You go back and tell our mother and them

16
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,360
You don’t have to wait for me to eat at noon

17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,640
you have to leave now

18
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:33,260
But you didn’t even bring me dry food, so I went to the island.

19
00:00:33,260 --> 00:00:34,380
Can you still starve yourself?

20
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:35,660
When the time comes, just grab some sea greens or something.

21
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:36,660
Just crack it open and you can eat it.

22
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:37,620
Let's light a fire ourselves

23
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:38,860
Grill some fish

24
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,900
Just go

25
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,500
You never listened to me anyway

26
00:00:59,640 --> 00:01:01,120
Brother, are you here to sail the boat?
